  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1730211609_6032018_7abdbdf95b93633f74a2ff22c24fa462.jpeg",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 249, 243); float: none; display: inline;\">The formulation for Inana was created out of necessity. There are so many opportunities and therapies for male sexual health, but very few options for women. In fact, to this day, many of the options for women consist of trying to improve the desire to have sex, assuming that would be all it would take. in addition, lubricants, which may be helpful, are only a small part of the equation.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 249, 243); margin-block: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 249, 243); margin-block: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(253, 249, 243); float: none; display: inline;\">A group came together, which combined a nutritional scientist, a board-certified urologist, a board-certified, vascular surgeon, and a world renowned aesthetic gynecologist. Works together a formula was put together to be used topically and provide the answer to so many women who were having difficulty with sexual function.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(26, 26, 26); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; backgrou